OL,5,G2100 Grand Designs
OL,6,     FKevin revisits Stuart and Rosie on
OL,7,     Fthe Wirral, who turned their 60s
OL,8,     Fbungalow into an ultra-modern
OL,9,     Fwooden family home for #175k. Is
OL,10,     Fit finished yet? And have the
OL,11,     Fneighbours grown to like it?
OL,12,G2200 Kevin McCloud's Classic Car...
OL,13,     F...Road Trips: Kevin gets behind
OL,14,     Fthe wheel of an iconic DeLorean.
